      ],
      "comment": "Serpent of All Evils: The Three Sealing Pillars",
      "content": "Three stone pillars in Dreadshade Mire hold the seal laid by the Torchforger and the Moonchanter. Their strength is not special power but kuuvahki and the strength the founders left behind; channelling kuuvahki into each restores the seal, and Spirebloom in the swamp can wound the monster. Each carries an inscription naming one of Raimo's three sins.",
