      ],
      "comment": "Serpent of All Evils: The Last Night, the First Light",
      "content": "In the final world quest of the Nightingale's Song story, the Traveler and Illuga prepare the Arrow of Terpikeraunas at Piramida. During the defence the Serpent of All Evils is heard crying about unforgivable sins and its fall, followed by the Ultimate Calamity. Paimon recognises him as the monster from the swamp if the Traveler has done that quest.",
